    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "A persistence-derived credence traces back from the held math:ResidualInterpretationClaim (through gmeow:wasDerivedFrom to the math:StabilityCalibrationRecord, its math:calibrationEvidence lifetimes, and their math:overFiltration) to the filtration, the birth/death thresholds, and the math:bottleneckStabilityTheorem that calibrated it. Over the fixture the claim ex:latentMeaningClaim has two evidence lifetimes, so the answer is exactly the essential H0 component (born ex:eps1, dies math:PositiveInfinity) and the H1 loop (born ex:eps2, dies ex:eps4), each over ex:persistenceFiltration, guaranteed by math:bottleneckStabilityTheorem at logic:confidence 0.82." ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqFiltrationPersistenceStabilityShape ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:rowPersistenceEssential , ex:rowPersistenceLoop .
