    gmeow:cqRationale "A math:Estimate names its math:Estimator (math:estimator) and math:Estimand (math:estimatesEstimand) and is produced by a math:InferenceRun process (gmeow:wasGeneratedBy); the run fits the math:DatasetMatrix data (math:fittedToData) and the math:FittedModel over that same data carries its math:ModelAssumption (math:modelAssumption) — so a statistical result is the traceable output of a method over data under stated assumptions, by a named process. Over the fixture the answer is exactly {treatmentEffectEstimate → run analysisRun, data trialData, model trialFittedModel, estimator olsEstimator, estimand averageTreatmentEffect, assumption normalErrors}." ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqStatisticsEstimateProvenanceShape ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:rowEstimateProvenance .

