# The closed-form scene: the exact operator tree of T(x) = A·x⁻ᵖ − B·(1−x)⁻q + C
# recovered node by node — nine math:ApplicationExpression nodes with their operators.
ex:cqRadialFieldClosedForm a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQueryFile "slices/grounding/math/queries/competency/radial-field-closed-form.rq" ;
    gmeow:cqDataFile "examples/signed-radial-field-closed-form.ttl" ;
    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "The closed-form flagship scene stores the exact signed compactified curve T(x) = A·x⁻ᵖ − B·(1−x)⁻q + C as a structured AST; the competency recovers the operator tree by traversing math:argumentSlot/math:slotExpression to arbitrary depth. Over the scene the answer is exactly the nine operator nodes: rcf:cfBodyAdd → math:Addition, rcf:cfOuterSub → math:Subtraction, rcf:cfTermA and rcf:cfTermB → math:Multiplication, rcf:cfPowX and rcf:cfPowOneMinusX → math:Exponentiation, rcf:cfOneMinusX → math:Subtraction, and rcf:cfNegP and rcf:cfNegQ → math:Negation — the operand structure recovered node by node." ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqRadialCFShape ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:rowCFBodyAdd , ex:rowCFOuterSub , ex:rowCFTermA , ex:rowCFPowX ,
        ex:rowCFNegP , ex:rowCFTermB , ex:rowCFPowOneMinusX , ex:rowCFOneMinusX , ex:rowCFNegQ .

ex:cqRadialCFShape a logic:ResultShape ;
    logic:declaresColumn
        [ logic:columnVariable "node" ; logic:columnTermKind logic:TermKindIri ; logic:columnBinding logic:BindingRequired ] ,
        [ logic:columnVariable "operator" ; logic:columnTermKind logic:TermKindIri ; logic:columnBinding logic:BindingRequired ] ;
    logic:shapeCardinality logic:RowsExact .

